#
# clang-tidy settings for the tests: app/.clang-tidy, with one more check
# disabled, with its reason.
---
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -cppcoreguidelines-non-private-member-variables-in-classes

# Why:
#   cppcoreguidelines-non-private-member-variables-in-classes
#       Google style allows a test fixture's data members to be protected,
#       and the test harnesses expose what they recorded for the tests to
#       check.
